<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac cuts no frills home loan rate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac cuts no frills home loan rate.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp Ltd said on Friday it had cut the variable interest rate on its no frills First Option home loan to 7.89 percent from 8.40 percent in anticipation of cut in official cash interest rates.</p>
<p>Westpac said it cut the variable rate on its main Premium Option home loan to 9.25 percent from 9.30 percent.</p>
<p>It also cut the rate on its fixed one year investment property loan to 7.50 percent from 8.35 percent.</p>
<p>The new rates are effective from November 1 for new and existing customers.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
